---
import bird from "../assets/sisu_bird.png";
import sun from "../assets/inclusivity_sun.png";
import tree from "../assets/responsibility_tree.png";
import PageSection from "./PageSection.astro";

import "../styles/tokens.css";
---

<div class="value-cards-container">
    <div class="value-card">
        <div class="content sisu">
            <div class="front">
                <div class="front-image-container">
                    <img class="value-img" src={bird.src} />
                    <div class="front-label">Sisu</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="back">
                <div class="back-text">
                    <p>
                        <strong>Sisu </strong> a Finnish concept, encompassing the
                        qualities of perseverance and determination. Reflective of
                        SISU, our swallow is a representation of an extraordinarily
                        agile bird that embodies grit, resilience and strength qualities
                        Kiva aims to foster in all its stakeholders.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mob-text">
        <p>
            <strong>Sisu </strong> a Finnish concept, encompassing the qualities
            of perseverance and determination. Reflective of SISU, our swallow is
            a representation of an extraordinarily agile bird that embodies grit,
            resilience and strength qualities Kiva aims to foster in all its stakeholders.
        </p>
    </div>
    <div class="value-card">
        <div class="content inclusivity">
            <div class="front">
                <div class="front-image-container">
                    <img class="value-img" src={sun.src} class="front" />
                    <div class="front-label">Inclusivity</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="back">
                <div class="back-text">
                    <p>
                        Much like the sun, and how it shines over everyone
                        without prejudice, <strong>Inclusivity</strong> is at Kiva's
                        core. Fostering a welcoming and equitable space where everyone's
                        differences are celebrated through a community rooted in
                        kindness, making parts of a whole.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mob-text">
        <p>
            Much like the sun, and how it shines over everyone without
            prejudice, <strong>Inclusivity</strong> is at Kiva's core. Fostering
            a welcoming and equitable space where everyone's differences are celebrated
            through a community rooted in kindness, making parts of a whole.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="value-card">
        <div class="content social-responsibility">
            <div class="front">
                <div class="front-image-container">
                    <img class="value-img" src={tree.src} class="front" />
                    <div class="front-label">Social Responsibility</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="back">
                <div class="back-text">
                    <p>
                        Learning to care for the environment and forming a deep
                        connection with nature is considered paramount at Kiva.
                        Respecting the life around us, understanding that we
                        don't exist in a vacuum and that all Life is
                        interconnected, is the key to cultivating empathy and
                        <strong>Social Responsibility</strong> in all our interactions.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mob-text">
        <p>
            Learning to care for the environment and forming a deep connection
            with nature is considered paramount at Kiva. Respecting the life
            around us, understanding that we don't exist in a vacuum and that
            all Life is interconnected, is the key to cultivating empathy and
            <strong>Social Responsibility</strong> in all our interactions.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .value-cards-container {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-evenly;
    }
    .value-card {
        width: 300px;
        height: 400px;
        perspective: 500px;
    }

    .content {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        justify-content: center;
        border-width: 6px;
        border-style: solid;
        border-radius: 42px;
        position: absolute;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        transition: transform 1s;
        transform-style: preserve-3d;
    }

    .sisu {
        border-color: #c470e0;
    }

    .inclusivity {
        border-color: #fcc27b;
    }

    .social-responsibility {
        border-color: var(--color-teal);
    }

    .value-card:hover .content {
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
        transition: transform 0.5s;
    }

    .front {
        position: absolute;
        height: 56%;
        background: white;
        color: #03446a;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 60px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        backface-visibility: hidden;
        top: 23%;
        right: 16%;
    }

    .front-image-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .front-label {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 800;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .value-img {
        width: 200px;
        display: block;
    }

    .back {
        background: white;
        color: #03446a;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 60px;
        padding: 20px 20px;
        backface-visibility: hidden;
    }

    .back {
        font-size: 16px;
        transform: rotateY(180deg);
    }

    .mob-text {
        display: none;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1184px) {
        .mob-text {
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            display: block;
        }
        .value-cards-container {
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .value-card:hover .content {
            transform: none;
            transition: transform 0.5s;
        }
        .back {
            display: none;
            transform: none;
        }
    }
</style>
